    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html talks of `AudioTrack.id`, `HTMLMediaElement.readyState` and many similar constructs. As an example, how should \"The VideoTrackList.selectedIndex attribute must return the index of the currently selected track, if any.\" be rephrased?\n\nDoesn't \"`ProgressEvent`'s `lengthComputable` attribute\" also make it sound like the `ProgressEvent` interface object has a `lengthComputable` attribute?\n",
